# What must never reach the build context.
#
# Two jobs: keep secrets out of the image, and keep the context small - every
# excluded file is one the daemon does not have to receive.
#
# The Dockerfile already copies only `requirements.txt`, `CRM/config.py` and
# `CRM/app/`, so most of this is defence in depth: it also protects a future
# `COPY . .` from quietly embedding something it should not.

# NOTE on pattern depth: a pattern without "**" only matches at the ROOT of
# the build context. `__pycache__/` alone would NOT exclude
# `CRM/app/__pycache__/` - which is exactly how stale bytecode ended up in a
# first build of this image. `**/` makes a pattern depth-independent.

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The one entry that matters most. An image can be pushed to a registry,
# pulled by anyone with access, and inspected layer by layer. A .env baked in
# is a credential published.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.json

# --- Version control -------------------------------------------------------
# Not just size: the history can hold values that were removed from the
# working tree but still exist in an old commit.
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Local databases -------------------------------------------------------
# The historical SQLite artefact, ~6 MB, unused since the PostgreSQL
# migration. It has no business inside the image.
CRM/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# --- The frontend ----------------------------------------------------------
# The Dockerfile builds the API only, and copies just CRM/. Without this
# entry the whole frontend still reaches the daemon as build context: adding
# it took the context from 76 kB to 42.7 MB, almost all of it the 2,300 files
# under node_modules. Excluded wholesale - when the frontend is containerised
# it will get a Dockerfile and a context of its own.
frontend/

# --- Node --------------------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.npm/
**/npm-debug.log*

# --- Python environments and caches ----------------------------------------
**/.venv/
**/venv/
ENV/
env/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

# --- Test and tooling caches -----------------------------------------------
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editors and OS --------------------------------------------------------
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Logs and scratch ------------------------------------------------------
**/*.log
logs/
tmp/

# --- Not needed at runtime -------------------------------------------------
# Documentation and the CRM tooling: useful in the repository, dead weight in
# a running API container.
**/*.md
CRM/scripts/
CRM/tests/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
